  {"date": "2018-12-29", "venue": "Madison Square Garden", "city": "New York", "state": "NY", "gap": 2, "set": "1", "jamchart": true, "jam": "Around 5:30, the playing shifts from the usual fire and brimstone stuff to a quieter, percussive groove. As Page and Trey link up, the jam develops energy and a brighter tone. The band neatly modifies the energy up and down several times, before cleverly -> to \"Cities.\"", "out": ">", "nb": 1, "prev": "The Sloth", "next": "Cities"},
