  {"date": "2024-08-04", "venue": "Ruoff Music Center", "city": "Noblesville", "state": "IN", "gap": 7, "set": "1", "jamchart": true, "jam": "Cool version. Near the 6:00 mark, Trey lays into languid, off-kilter, near-melodic variation, his soloing seemingly aimless before, with Fish, settling on a great passage unsettling previous play, the segment completely discordant, before abruptly, yet adroitly, returning to close and > \"McGrupp.\"", "nb": 1, "prev": "Destiny Unbound", "in": ">", "next": "McGrupp and the Watchful Hosemasters"},
  {"date": "2024-08-11", "venue": "Bethel Woods Center for the Arts", "city": "Bethel", "state": "NY", "gap": 5, "set": "1", "jamchart": true, "jam": "Trey screws around early, setting a great (if strange) tone, and an excellent, somewhat demented jam develops. Naturally, Mike features heavily. Some of the most off-beat Phish - the sort of improv one could listen to for days - does, in time, sync up, building to an upbeat, if familiar, conclusion.", "nb": 1, "prev": "I Never Needed You Like This Before", "next": "Bathtub Gin"},
